from pptx import Presentation
from collections import defaultdict
prs=Presentation('slides/output/presentation.pptx')
# find largest text box on each slide by area and output its first line
for idx, s in enumerate(prs.slides, start=1):
    best=None
    for sh in s.shapes:
        if not hasattr(sh,'text_frame'):
            continue
        if not sh.has_text_frame:
            continue
        text=sh.text.strip()
        if not text:
